    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/582c2c5a5ae469b08af762e184fd4f15.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span><br>An emergency has occurred at the underground facilities of Inturg Technologies. Trapped in a metallic maze and engulfed in darkness with no apparent means of escape, four employees discover access to an internal group chat. United by their dire circumstances, they must unravel the enigmatic origins of the crisis and find a way to survive.<br><br>What triggered the emergency? What is the true purpose of Inturg Technologies? And amidst the chaos, will they be able to trust each other?<br><br>CAN I REMEMBER MYSELF?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/f704ee0c9a8ff69dff342bbff0da1c2b.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a visual novel of mystery and thrill inside an old computer interface.<br></li><li>Enjoy a non-linear story through 4 different chat records containing the point of view of each character.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/9395b36eae74717e6d004ed3ee6ea84c.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/582c2c5a5ae469b08af762e184fd4f15.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span><br>An emergency has occurred at the underground facilities of Inturg Technologies. Trapped in a metallic maze and engulfed in darkness with no apparent means of escape, four employees discover access to an internal group chat. United by their dire circumstances, they must unravel the enigmatic origins of the crisis and find a way to survive.<br><br>What triggered the emergency? What is the true purpose of Inturg Technologies? And amidst the chaos, will they be able to trust each other?<br><br>CAN I REMEMBER MYSELF?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/f704ee0c9a8ff69dff342bbff0da1c2b.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a visual novel of mystery and thrill inside an old computer interface.<br></li><li>Enjoy a non-linear story through 4 different chat records containing the point of view of each character.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506730/extras/9395b36eae74717e6d004ed3ee6ea84c.avif?t=1703209999\" /></span>",
